{
  "$type": "com.atproto.lexicon.schema",
  "defs": {
    "main": {
      "description": "Everything a Grain app does as an account: write and delete Grain's records in its repository, and call Grain's methods at the service the include names (`include:social.grain.authFull?aud=did:web:grain.social%23grain_appview`). Grows as Grain does: a collection or method added here reaches signed-in accounts as their tokens are refreshed.",
